@@ -29,14 +29,22 @@
 name: iOS compile
 
 on:
+  # Batch lane (docs/ops/proposed/ci-speed.md, change 4): a pull request starts a macOS run only when it changes
+  # native files, the same list scripts/agents/merge-queue.mjs treats as gating (NATIVE_PATHS) plus this
+  # workflow. Every other mobile change is launched once per merge into develop: one run covers a batch of
